<title>POLAND: PBR SIGNS $10 MLN LOAN DEAL.</title>
<headline>PBR SIGNS $10 MLN LOAN DEAL.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-05-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Polish Development Bank (PBR) has signed a contract with Danish-Polish joint venture Prime Food Sp z oo to provide a $9.9 million loan for the building of a meat processing plant, the bank said in a statement on Tuesday.</p>
<p>PBR's share is part of $20 million in loans co-financed by Den Danske Bank </p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
